{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#144","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#144","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#144\",\"parent_revision\":\"867c0be40cdfecc533080c565b1845bfa44fc711472f29d9ac4a6d7a568ff339\",\"root_revision\":\"867c0be40cdfecc533080c565b1845bfa44fc711472f29d9ac4a6d7a568ff339\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Files\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- `packages/skilllint/plugin_validator.py` \u2014 `_get_fixers_for_path`, the `can_fix()` call site\\n</div>\\n\\n## The Defect\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n`--fix` calls every validator's `can_fix()` and then `fix()` regardless of whether that validator reported anything for the file being fixed. A writer therefore runs on files its own rule never flagged.\\n\\nThis is the amplifier in #114: PL006's relocation fix rewrote `marketplace.json` files PL006 had not flagged. #114 neutralises the *effect* for PL006 by making `PluginStructureValidator.can_fix()` permanently `False`. The mechanism is untouched and still applies to every other fixer \u2014 including `NameFormatValidator`/FM010.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Why It Is Its Own Issue\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n#114's design brief (\u00a76) scoped this out deliberately: the blast radius crosses every fixer in `plugin_validator.py`, and widening that diff would have buried the ordering-sensitive PL006 fix. That call was right, but it leaves the bug class that produced #114 live.\\n\\nThe invariant that is missing: a validator's `fix()` runs only against findings that same validator's `validate()` produced for that same path.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Related\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- #114 \u2014 where this was found and locally neutralised\\n- #117 \u2014 `--fix` mutates files without reporting what it changed; same surface, different defect\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"67389fb91595d42c2fbde0aa6132ed090d3842d0988485901cd02f94f00a03c3\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDORXxKvc8AAAABXP-JlQ\"}"}